SUMMARY:Dia de los Muertos
LOCATION:Hollywood Forever\, Hollywood
DESCRIPTION:27TH ANNUAL DIA DE LOS MUERTOS AT HOLLYWOOD FOREVER ALL UNDER O
 
NE SKY - BAJO UN MISMO CIELO SATURDAY OCTOBER 24TH 2026 NOON - MIDNIGHT FEA
 
TURING: DANNYLUX TRISH TOLEDO TROPA MAGICA LOS SHADOWS DJ QUE MADRE DJ JOAQ
 
U.N DJ DRO BARLO THERE ARE 3 WINDOWS OF ADMISSION: 12PM-4PM 4PM-7PM 7PM-11P
 
M YOU MAY STAY PAST YOUR WINDOW OF ADMISSSION EVENT WEBSITE: ladayofthedead
 
.com ALTARS EXHIBITION CEREMONIAL PROCESSION MUSICAL PERFORMANCES ON THE MU
 
ERTE Y TRADICIÓN STAGE CHILDRENS PLAZA El CINE & EL TEATRO PLAZA CATHEDRAL
 
 ART EXHIBITION AZTECS FOLKLORICO ARTS & CRAFTS VENDORS CULINARY VENDORS AW
 
ARDS Altars : Winner $5\,000\, 2nd $3500\, 3rd $2500 Costumes: Winner $1000
 
 & Runner Up $500 VIP TICKETS The VIP ticket gives you access to the VIP Oa
 
sis in the middle of the event which includes premium food and beverage ven
 
dors for purchase\, lounge seating\, private main stage viewing area\, cell
 
 phone charging\, free WIFI\, and premium face painting vendors for purchas
 
e. Free beverage tastings on 1st come 1st served basis. VISIT LADAYOFTHEDEA
 
D.COM FOR FULL SCHEDULE OF EVENTS * LINEUP AND SCHEDULE SUBJECT TO CHANGE A
 
T ANY TIME * * NO REFUNDS / NO EXCHANGES * * 5 AND UP REQUIRE TICKETS * PAR
 
KING Parking in structures on Van Ness Ave and Gower St and additional loca
 
tions. More details emailed to ticket purchasers prior to event date. ABOUT
 
 THE THEME: This past year has reminded us how deeply our lives are woven t
 
ogether. Across the world\, families have endured separation\, communities 
 
have mourned\, and many have searched for peace\, comfort\, and healing. In
 
 times of sorrow\, we are reminded that suffering knows no borders---and ne
 
ither should compassion. Yet even in difficult times\, there are moments th
 
at draw us closer. Through music\, art\, tradition\, celebration\, and reme
 
mbrance\, people gather across cultures and continents to share joy\, offer
 
 comfort\, and dream together. In those moments\, the distance between us s
 
eems to disappear\, revealing the bonds that have always connected us. The 
 
same sun rises over each of us. The same moon watches over those we love. T
 
he same stars that guided our ancestors continue to shine above us today. W
 
herever we may stand upon this earth\, we are all bajo un mismo cielo --- u
 
nder one sky. Día de los Muertos reminds us that love knows no borders. Me
 
mory belongs to us all. Grief belongs to us all. Hope belongs to us all. Wh
 
en we gather to honor our ancestors\, we are reminded that every life leave
 
s behind a story---and every story is worthy of being remembered. Tickets &
 
 info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/dia-de-los-muertos-hollywood-forever
 
-tickets/15002103
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/dia-de-los-muertos-hollywood-forever-ti
 
ckets/15002103
END:VEVENT
