SUMMARY:Argentine Film Festival Supported by The Miracle Theater Foundation
LOCATION:The Miracle Theater\, Inglewood
DESCRIPTION:Saturday 24th 5pm CANELONES Argentina. 91m. Dir. Christian Basi
 
lis y Ana Laura Gussoni. During their teenage years in Mercedes\, Hernán a
 
nd his friend Chiri stave off boredom by making prank calls to neighbors. O
 
ne of these calls crosses the line\, deceiving a mother into believing her 
 
absent son is coming home for dinner\; she prepares cannelloni that go unea
 
ten\, and some time later\, she takes her own life. Saturday 24th 8pm YO\, 
 
NARCISO Argentina. 95m. Dir. Adrian Suar. The story follows Rocío Flores (
 
Natalia Oreiro)\, a sociology professor who decides to investigate modern n
 
arcissism. For her study\, she chooses Máximo Rey (Adrián Suar) a charism
 
atic and egocentric plastic surgeon as her subject. Rocío goes undercover 
 
using a false identity\, posing as a patient. However\, the experiment beco
 
mes complicated when Máximo falls in love with her and the situation spira
 
ls out of control. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com/argentine-f
 
ilm-festival-supported-by-the-inglewood-california-10-24-2026/event/0B00654
 
